    // ── app-*.js empty states and load errors (v6.4.1, pass 5) ──
    // Hand-written, not templated. "No X." and "Failed to load X." look like
    // they could be generated from a noun glossary, but French/Spanish/Arabic
    // gender agreement (Aucun hôte vs Aucune règle) and Hindi/Chinese word order
    // make a substitution table produce confidently wrong grammar — which is
    // worse than the English fallback, per the project's own i18n rule.
